        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. 1. A permanent or conditional unit member shall be eligible each year for a one-step salary increment. Such salary increments may be awarded annually until a unit member reaches the top pay step (not including longevity) of the pay grade to which his/her position is assigned.",
            "block_bbox": [
                39,
