        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. A fully qualified unit member who is promoted to a higher grade position shall be assigned at the lowest step of such higher grade which exceeds his/her existing step by two steps; however, if there is no step in the higher grade which exceeds his/her existing step by two (2) steps, the unit member will be placed at the top of the grade.",
